      "created_at": "2014-10-17T00:38:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Elmer's glue. Mix 1 part glue with 1 part water, then paint on after the paint is all dry. It goes on white and gross, but it dries clear, and makes a nice, solid shell that protects the paint nicely.</p>",
